            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" author_heading="ARISTAGORAS" work_heading="MAMMAKYTHOS" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0419-mammakythos-4">
              <note type="source">Grammaticus Bekk. Anecd. p. 404 28.</note>
              <quote>Ἀνθέων: τὴν γενικὴν ὁμοίως τοῖς Ἴωσιν οἱ Ἀττικοί — καὶ Ἀρισταγόρας Μαμμακύθῳ.</quote>
              <note type="apparatus">Eadem Suidas v. ἀνθέων.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5_6_7" author_heading="ARISTAGORAS" work_heading="MAMMAKYTHOS" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0419-mammakythos-5_6_7">
              <note type="source">Photius p. 530 1.</note>
              <quote>σπεῖρα: ἡ συστροφὴ καὶ τὸ ἄθροισμα. οὐχ ὅπως παρὰ τοῖς τραγικοῖς, ἀλλὰ καὶ ἐν Μαμμακύθῳ.</quote>
              <note type="apparatus">Ex eadem Aristagorae fabulae petita videntur quae idem Photius habet p. 107 13. <quote>Ἰμάντας: τοὺς τῶν ἱστίων. Ἀρισταγόρας.</quote> Et p. 204 13. <quote>Λακκόπεδον: τοὺς ὄρχεις. οὕτως Ἀρισταγόρας.</quote> Ita enim pro Ἀνταγόρας scribendum videri indicavi Hist. crit. p. 220.</note>
            </div>
            </div></body></text></TEI>